{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s1a957fcb6ea9e7e4","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p15871-5f8a532c2d1519240c70","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s1a957fcb6ea9e7e4","text":"이런 걸 발견했어요…","speaker":"","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["8474604493374547520","15664900558041788200"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-45101b4a71bb78d6b874","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s1a957fcb6ea9e7e4","text":"이게 바로 그 예언이 가리키는 건가요? 의외네요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3435899860435728715"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-aa413f4fb8654c2c0c9f","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s1a957fcb6ea9e7e4","text":"가장자리가 평평하고, 외부의 힘에 의해 파괴된 흔적이 없는 것 같네요. 의도적으로 이런 모습으로 만들어진 것 같습니다","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3569650200181076480"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-e065d0887b595cfadf06","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s1a957fcb6ea9e7e4","text":"어쨌든 예언이 인도한 거라면 많을수록 좋을 겁니다. 일단 보관해 두시죠, 귀빈님","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9519946177557387958"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-b82a53626f94094fff98","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"s1a957fcb6ea9e7e4","text":"제게는 아직 풀지 못한 예언이 꽤 많습니다. 전부 처리하고 나서 그 뒤에 숨겨진 깊은 뜻을 함께 연구하시죠","speaker":"의상공","miss